    {"file":"fixture-refund-policy-v2025.md","visibility":"public","metadata":{"category":"refund","product":"API Platform","channel":"billing","version":"2025.12","effective_date":"2025-01-01"},"content":"# 退款政策（旧版 2025.12）\n\n这是仅用于盲测的已失效旧版政策。旧版允许在支付后 14 天内申请退款。当前版本已替换它；回答当前规则时不得引用本文件。"},
    {"file":"fixture-refund-policy-v2026.md","visibility":"public","metadata":{"category":"refund","product":"API Platform","channel":"billing","version":"2026.08","effective_date":"2026-07-01"},"content":"# 退款政策（当前版 2026.08）\n\n这是盲测当前政策。符合条件的购买可在支付后 7 天内提交退款申请。申请窗口不代表必然批准或到账；订单和账单状态必须经业务 Tool 核验。"},
    {"file":"fixture-billing-policy-v2025.md","visibility":"public","metadata":{"category":"billing","product":"API Platform","channel":"billing","plan":"Professional","version":"2025.12","effective_date":"2025-01-01"},"content":"# Professional 旧版计费（2025.12）\n\n仅用于版本冲突盲测：旧版基础费用为 199，月额度为 800000。它已失效，不得用于当前客户账单。"},
